LOAT"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "VHS_VideoCombine", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VHS_VideoCombine"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [82], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [323.5617370605469, 287.2890930175781], "pos": [1568.9354248046875, -1916.56884765625], "widgets_values": ["", "在一个阳光灿烂的夏日午后，两位18岁的情侣身穿轻便的夏装，少女穿着白色连衣裙，少年穿着蓝白条纹衬衫，脚踩帆布鞋，彰显青春活力。他们在一片绿色的宁静田野间奔跑，手中各握着一杯青桔柠檬汽水，汽水的透明杯子映出阳光的金色光斑，清凉感扑面而来。背景是一片层叠起伏的远山，天边点缀着几朵懒散的白云，透出明亮的蓝天。镜头从少女手中的汽水杯开始，逐渐向上移动捕捉她的笑颜，随后快速切换到两人并肩奔跑的画面，镜头向前拉升，展现两人的背影和远处无尽的田野，风吹起她的裙摆和他的衣襟，阳光在他们周围洒下温暖光晕，空气中似乎能闻到青草的味道。整个场景充满轻快的节奏，镜头采用手持跟拍，保持自然流动感，光线柔和明亮，画面色调偏向饱和的暖色系，营造出日系小清新的青春氛围。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 90, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 76, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "int", "slot_index": 0, "links": [60], "label": "int", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "size": [219.70021057128906, 58], "pos": [631.4197387695312, -1251.79736328125], "widgets_values": [848], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "Primitive integer [Crystools]", "title": "宽度", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Primitive integer [Crystools]"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "int", "slot_index": 0, "links": [61], "label": "int", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "size": [216.39381408691406, 58], "pos": [629.4197387695312, -1133.7974853515625], "widgets_values": [480], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "Primitive integer [Crystools]", "title": "高度", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Primitive integer [Crystools]"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "p0", "links": [90], "label": "p0", "type": "*", "localized_name": "p0"}], "size": [315, 58], "pos": [1183.135986328125, -1796.6468505859375], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "text_b_0", "link": 89